# Public Supabase config for the GitHub Pages build.
#
# These two values are PUBLIC BY DESIGN. Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into
# the JavaScript bundle, so anyone who loads the site can already read them from
# their browser's devtools — committing them here exposes nothing new.
#
# What actually protects the data is Row Level Security plus the security-definer
# RPCs in supabase/migrations/. The anon key grants no more than "an anonymous
# visitor", and every read of a hidden tile or an enemy fleet is denied by policy.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key here. That one bypasses RLS entirely and would
# hand every player both fleets and all 100 tile answers.
#
# Repo secrets of the same name still win if they are set (see the deploy
# workflow), so the key can be rotated without a commit if you ever want to.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://fjgcijmdxeebgkdokini.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImZqZ2Npam1keGVlYmdrZG9raW5pIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODgwOTYxMTIsImV4cCI6MjEwMzY3MjExMn0.DtTA3GZD2R2n5pbDxUN5_1SANav5I7rLpmJlxiDBdno
